# OpenClaw — System Architecture

## Infrastructure Layer Model

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  TENANT LAYER                        │
│   Auth (Clerk) · Billing · Permissions · Isolation   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                  AGENT RUNTIME                       │
│   Start/Stop · Gateway Proxy · Chat · History        │
├──────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┤
│  SKILL BUS   │         KNOWLEDGE GRAPH BUS           │
│              │                                       │
│  Skills are  │  Each graph is scoped to a tenant     │
│  registered  │  and tagged to one or more skills     │
│  in a        │                                       │
│  registry    │  Graph A: Investor Profiles           │
│              │  Graph B: Company Data Room           │
│  IRResearch  │  Graph C: Brand Guidelines            │
│  IROutreach  │  Graph D: Compliance Rules            │
│  LegalDraft  │  Graph N: ...                         │
│  HRScreen    │                                       │
│  ...         │                                       │
├──────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┤
│                  PLAYBOOK ENGINE                     │
│   A playbook = ordered skill chain + graph bindings  │
│   Tenant configures, platform executes               │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│               CONNECTOR REGISTRY                     │
│   CRM · Email · Slack · LinkedIn · Databases · APIs  │
│   Each skill declares which connectors it needs      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Service Topology (Render.com)

| Service | Name | Runtime | Plan |
|---|---|---|---|
| API Server | `openclaw-api` | Node.js | Starter |
| Frontend | `openclaw-saas` | Static | Free |
| Benchmark + ZOA + Kairos | `openclaw-benchmark` | Python (FastAPI) | Starter |
| Archon Factory | `archon-factory` | Node.js | Starter |
| Database | `openclaw-db` | PostgreSQL | Free |
| Per-tenant Gateway | `openclaw-gateway-{tenantId}` | Docker | Starter (dynamic) |

## Monorepo Structure

```
openclaw-saas/
├── artifacts/
│   ├── api-server/          # Express 5 API (Node.js)
│   └── openclaw-saas/       # React + Vite frontend
├── lib/
│   ├── db/                  # Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL schema (28 tables)
│   ├── api-spec/            # OpenAPI spec + Orval codegen
│   ├── api-client-react/    # Generated React Query hooks
│   ├── api-zod/             # Generated Zod schemas
│   ├── crypto-utils/        # AES-256-GCM credential encryption
│   ├── gateway-provisioner/ # Render Deploy API client
│   └── skill-contract/      # Skill interface + ConnectorDef types
├── packages/
│   ├── archon/              # Archon workflow config + YAML definitions
│   └── archon-factory/      # Skill generation pipeline (Express service)
└── scripts/                 # DB migration, seeding utilities
```

## Tenant Isolation Model

- Each tenant gets their own `OPENCLAW_CONFIG_DIR=/tenants/{tenant_id}` directory
- Per-tenant Docker volume on Render — zero cross-contamination
- Per-tenant Gateway instance: `openclaw-gateway-{tenantId}.onrender.com`
- All DB rows scoped by `tenant_id` — no shared data across tenants

## Auth Architecture

- **Frontend**: Clerk `@clerk/react` — `<ClerkProvider>` wraps the app
- **API**: Clerk `@clerk/express` middleware — every route checks `getAuth(req).userId`
- **Cross-origin**: `customFetch` in `lib/api-client-react/src/custom-fetch.ts` sends `credentials: 'include'` on all requests
- **CORS**: API server configured with `cors({ credentials: true, origin: true })`
- **Service-to-service**: Bearer token via `OPENCLAW_SERVICE_TOKEN` env var

## Key Environment Variables

| Variable | Service | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `DATABASE_URL` | api-server | PostgreSQL connection |
| `CLERK_SECRET_KEY` | api-server | Clerk auth |
| `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` | api-server, benchmark | LLM inference |
| `RENDER_API_KEY` | api-server | Gateway provisioning |
| `RENDER_OWNER_ID` | api-server | Render account |
| `KAIROS_SERVICE_URL` | api-server | Kairos execution engine |
| `BENCHMARK_SERVICE_URL` | api-server | Benchmark + ZOA service |
| `VITE_API_URL` | frontend | API base URL |
| `VITE_ZOA_SERVICE_URL` | frontend | ZOA agent API |
| `VITE_ARCHON_FACTORY_URL` | frontend | Archon factory |

## Adding a New Route

1. Add the OpenAPI operation to `lib/api-spec/openapi.yaml`
2. Run `pnpm --filter @workspace/api-spec run codegen` to regenerate Zod schemas and React Query hooks
3. Create or extend a route file in `artifacts/api-server/src/routes/`
4. Mount the router in `artifacts/api-server/src/routes/index.ts`
5. Run `pnpm run typecheck` — must pass before committing
